# directive - no separate mercure/ container is used here). MERCURE_PUBLISHER_JWT_KEY/
# MERCURE_SUBSCRIBER_JWT_KEY come from .env.dev.local/.env.prod.local (see compose.yaml's comment
# on why credential-shaped vars are never defaulted here) - deliberately two distinct secrets, not
# one shared MERCURE_JWT_SECRET, so config/packages/mercure.yaml defines two hubs accordingly.
###< symfony/mercure-bundle ###

